Dialogue: 4,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,your phone this morning,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:03.13,0:00:04.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,let's pray Bible verses
Dialogue: 4,0:00:04.76,0:00:07.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,for peace over the day ahead.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:07.69,0:00:10.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your hands rest for a moment,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:10.23,0:00:11.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,if you can.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:11.26,0:00:13.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may already be thinking
Dialogue: 4,0:00:13.52,0:00:14.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,about a message,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.86,0:00:17.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,a meeting, or somebody you love.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:17.71,0:00:20.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bring that one concern with you.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:20.28,0:00:21.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can join these
Dialogue: 4,0:00:21.82,0:00:24.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,prayers aloud or quietly.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:24.15,0:00:25.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,We begin with Paul's
Dialogue: 4,0:00:25.80,0:00:27.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,words in Philippians,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:27.54,0:00:29.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,chapter four, verse six.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:30.71,0:00:32.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be careful for nothing;
Dialogue: 5,0:00:32.85,0:00:34.87,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}but in every thing by prayer
Dialogue: 5,0:00:34.87,0:00:37.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and supplication with thanksgiving let
Dialogue: 5,0:00:37.62,0:00:40.65,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}your requests be made known unto God.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:41.78,0:00:42.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:42.34,0:00:44.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,here is the concern that reached
Dialogue: 4,0:00:44.95,0:00:46.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,me before I even
Dialogue: 4,0:00:46.25,0:00:47.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,got out of bed.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:47.65,0:00:49.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring it into this prayer
Dialogue: 4,0:00:49.64,0:00:51.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,without tidying it up.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:51.44,0:00:53.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am grateful that I can
Dialogue: 4,0:00:53.23,0:00:55.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,speak honestly with you.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:55.20,0:00:57.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me with the part I understand,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:57.81,0:00:59.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,and guide me through
Dialogue: 4,0:00:59.30,0:01:01.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,the part I cannot see.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:01.12,0:01:03.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,I offer you this morning,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:03.08,0:01:05.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,with its unfinished plans
Dialogue: 4,0:01:05.04,0:01:07.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,and ordinary responsibilities.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:07.57,0:01:10.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Please teach me to receive your peace
Dialogue: 4,0:01:10.20,0:01:13.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,while I take the next faithful step.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:13.94,0:01:15.52,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}And the peace of God,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:15.52,0:01:17.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}which passeth all understanding,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:17.94,0:01:19.60,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}shall keep your hearts
Dialogue: 5,0:01:19.60,0:01:22.28,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and minds through Christ Jesus.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:23.42,0:01:25.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have heard an invitation
Dialogue: 4,0:01:25.58,0:01:27.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,to bring everything to God.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.84,0:01:29.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,The older phrase about being
Dialogue: 4,0:01:29.79,0:01:32.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,careful speaks to anxious care.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:32.14,0:01:34.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can take your responsibilities
Dialogue: 4,0:01:34.42,0:01:36.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,seriously while bringing
Dialogue: 4,0:01:36.03,0:01:37.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,their weight into prayer.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:37.88,0:01:40.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may still have unanswered
Dialogue: 4,0:01:40.03,0:01:42.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,questions when these minutes end.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:42.65,0:01:44.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can still walk toward
Dialogue: 4,0:01:44.41,0:01:46.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,your responsibilities with
Dialogue: 4,0:01:46.24,0:01:48.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,those words beside you:
Dialogue: 4,0:01:48.04,0:01:51.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,hearts and minds kept through Christ.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:51.06,0:01:53.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are welcome here even if
Dialogue: 4,0:01:53.02,0:01:54.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,your thoughts keep
Dialogue: 4,0:01:54.29,0:01:56.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,interrupting your prayer.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:57.23,0:01:57.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:57.61,0:02:00.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name the worry plainly before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:00.54,0:02:03.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,I need help with this situation.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:03.30,0:02:05.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have been rehearsing conversations
Dialogue: 4,0:02:05.94,0:02:08.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,that have not happened and trying
Dialogue: 4,0:02:08.36,0:02:10.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,to solve decisions that are
Dialogue: 4,0:02:10.34,0:02:11.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,not mine to make.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:11.76,0:02:13.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Gather my attention around
Dialogue: 4,0:02:13.82,0:02:16.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,what is actually before me.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:16.14,0:02:18.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me courage to make the call,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:18.71,0:02:21.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,patience to wait for information,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:21.27,0:02:24.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,and humility to ask a clear question.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:24.32,0:02:26.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I have filled the gaps
Dialogue: 4,0:02:26.31,0:02:28.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,with frightening guesses,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:28.08,0:02:28.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,lead me back
Dialogue: 4,0:02:28.94,0:02:30.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,to what I truly know.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:31.60,0:02:33.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,I thank you for something
Dialogue: 4,0:02:33.46,0:02:35.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,small and real this morning:
Dialogue: 4,0:02:35.71,0:02:37.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,a drink of water,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:37.00,0:02:38.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,light through a window,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:38.75,0:02:41.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,a person whose kindness I remember.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:41.59,0:02:44.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,I receive these gifts without requiring
Dialogue: 4,0:02:44.77,0:02:47.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,them to explain away my trouble.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:47.57,0:02:50.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let gratitude make room in my attention
Dialogue: 4,0:02:50.64,0:02:53.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,for goodness I have overlooked.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:53.25,0:02:54.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,As I ask for help,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.84,0:02:57.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,remind me of help already given.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:57.85,0:03:00.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me willing to notice another gift,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:00.77,0:03:03.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,even in a crowded and imperfect day.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:04.64,0:03:07.49,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Thou wilt keep him in perfect peace,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:07.49,0:03:09.96,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}whose mind is stayed on thee:
Dialogue: 5,0:03:09.96,0:03:12.51,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}because he trusteth in thee.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.64,0:03:15.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can let this verse
Dialogue: 4,0:03:15.29,0:03:17.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,become a place to return.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:17.34,0:03:19.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your attention may wander
Dialogue: 4,0:03:19.33,0:03:21.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,toward the appointment,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:21.15,0:03:22.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,the unfinished task,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:22.74,0:03:24.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,or yesterday's mistake.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:24.75,0:03:26.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,When you notice that,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:26.18,0:03:28.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,bring your thoughts back gently.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:28.54,0:03:31.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to count distractions
Dialogue: 4,0:03:31.65,0:03:35.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,or turn prayer into another examination.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:35.20,0:03:36.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are learning where
Dialogue: 4,0:03:36.72,0:03:38.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,to rest your trust.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:38.22,0:03:41.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Isaiah points your attention toward God,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:41.32,0:03:43.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,whose faithfulness can hold
Dialogue: 4,0:03:43.41,0:03:45.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,your concern while you attend
Dialogue: 4,0:03:45.66,0:03:47.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,to the person or task
Dialogue: 4,0:03:47.28,0:03:48.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,in front of you.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:49.70,0:03:51.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Take an easy breath and let
Dialogue: 4,0:03:51.81,0:03:54.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,it leave without forcing it.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:54.17,0:03:56.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Notice where you are sitting
Dialogue: 4,0:03:56.22,0:03:57.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,or standing.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:57.27,0:03:58.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,For this quiet moment,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:58.94,0:04:00.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can leave the next
Dialogue: 4,0:04:00.61,0:04:02.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,task where it is.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:02.08,0:04:04.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your prayer be simple:
Dialogue: 4,0:04:04.38,0:04:05.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father, I am here,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:05.88,0:04:07.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I am listening.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:11.15,0:04:11.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:11.48,0:04:13.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me notice what I invite
Dialogue: 4,0:04:13.80,0:04:15.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,into my mind today.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:15.55,0:04:18.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me discernment with headlines,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:18.23,0:04:19.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,conversations,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:19.31,0:04:21.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the little screen that can
Dialogue: 4,0:04:21.61,0:04:23.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,fill every spare moment.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:23.62,0:04:26.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I reach for more information
Dialogue: 4,0:04:26.08,0:04:27.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,because I feel unsettled,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:27.94,0:04:31.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me recognize what I actually need.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:31.02,0:04:32.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lead me toward truth,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:32.76,0:04:33.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,useful action,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:33.92,0:04:36.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,and enough quiet to listen.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:36.34,0:04:38.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for a steadier attention,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:38.68,0:04:41.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,so the people beside me receive
Dialogue: 4,0:04:41.02,0:04:42.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,my presence instead
Dialogue: 4,0:04:42.45,0:04:45.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,of the distracted remainder of it.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:46.20,0:04:48.00,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Peace I leave with you,
Dialogue: 5,0:04:48.00,0:04:50.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}my peace I give unto you:
Dialogue: 5,0:04:50.14,0:04:52.18,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}not as the world giveth,
Dialogue: 5,0:04:52.18,0:04:53.73,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}give I unto you.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:53.73,0:04:56.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let not your heart be troubled,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:56.09,0:04:58.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,neither let it be afraid.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:59.48,0:05:02.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jesus speaks these words to disciples
Dialogue: 4,0:05:02.45,0:05:04.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,facing a difficult farewell.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:04.88,0:05:07.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can hear them in a morning
Dialogue: 4,0:05:07.19,0:05:09.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,that also feels uncertain.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:09.37,0:05:11.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,His gift does not depend on every
Dialogue: 4,0:05:11.92,0:05:14.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,person agreeing with you or every
Dialogue: 4,0:05:14.46,0:05:16.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,plan working smoothly.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:16.33,0:05:18.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can receive his words
Dialogue: 4,0:05:18.15,0:05:20.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,while your calendar is full
Dialogue: 4,0:05:20.11,0:05:22.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,and your feelings are mixed.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:22.32,0:05:23.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let them reach the part
Dialogue: 4,0:05:23.93,0:05:26.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,of you that assumes everything
Dialogue: 4,0:05:26.03,0:05:28.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,must be settled before you are allowed
Dialogue: 4,0:05:28.69,0:05:30.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,to breathe or be kind.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:31.41,0:05:31.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jesus,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:31.93,0:05:34.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,I receive the peace you offer.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:34.71,0:05:36.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have tried to earn calm by
Dialogue: 4,0:05:36.96,0:05:38.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,checking every detail and
Dialogue: 4,0:05:38.97,0:05:40.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,pleasing every person.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:40.92,0:05:43.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,That effort has left me tired.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:43.56,0:05:45.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me to make room
Dialogue: 4,0:05:45.15,0:05:47.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,for your presence within my
Dialogue: 4,0:05:47.20,0:05:48.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,responsibilities.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:48.66,0:05:50.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,When my plans change,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:50.28,0:05:52.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me pause long enough
Dialogue: 4,0:05:52.20,0:05:54.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,to respond thoughtfully.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:54.22,0:05:55.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I cannot make
Dialogue: 4,0:05:55.65,0:05:57.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,someone understand me,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:57.40,0:05:59.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,keep me truthful and gentle.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:59.80,0:06:01.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my need to control
Dialogue: 4,0:06:01.80,0:06:02.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,this day before
Dialogue: 4,0:06:02.96,0:06:04.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,you and ask for a willing,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:04.96,0:06:06.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,teachable heart.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:07.38,0:06:09.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,If any of you lack wisdom,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:09.55,0:06:11.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,let him ask of God,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:11.13,0:06:13.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,that giveth to all men liberally,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:13.88,0:06:15.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,and upbraideth not;
Dialogue: 5,0:06:15.64,0:06:18.04,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and it shall be given him.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:19.17,0:06:21.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may be opening a laptop,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:21.28,0:06:22.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,starting a shift,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:22.55,0:06:24.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,caring for someone, studying,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:24.73,0:06:26.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,or looking for work.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:26.41,0:06:29.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Each kind of work brings decisions.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:29.34,0:06:31.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can admit that you need wisdom
Dialogue: 4,0:06:31.85,0:06:34.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,without pretending you have failed.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:34.60,0:06:37.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,James gives you permission to ask.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:37.43,0:06:39.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can seek counsel,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:39.02,0:06:40.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,check the details,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:40.38,0:06:42.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,and learn from someone
Dialogue: 4,0:06:42.04,0:06:43.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,else's experience.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:43.58,0:06:45.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bring your next decision
Dialogue: 4,0:06:45.13,0:06:46.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,into this prayer,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:46.22,0:06:48.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,especially the one you feel pressured
Dialogue: 4,0:06:48.60,0:06:51.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,to make before you have understood it.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:52.23,0:06:52.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:52.76,0:06:54.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place the work ahead
Dialogue: 4,0:06:54.42,0:06:55.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,of me before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:55.88,0:06:57.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,Show me what deserves
Dialogue: 4,0:06:57.54,0:06:59.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,my attention first.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:59.22,0:07:01.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me begin the difficult task without
Dialogue: 4,0:07:01.92,0:07:04.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,spending the morning avoiding it.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:04.33,0:07:06.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me care with details
Dialogue: 4,0:07:06.23,0:07:08.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,that affect other people.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:08.31,0:07:09.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,If I make a mistake,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:09.94,0:07:11.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me acknowledge it
Dialogue: 4,0:07:11.74,0:07:13.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,and repair what I can.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:13.72,0:07:15.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my work be honest
Dialogue: 4,0:07:15.42,0:07:17.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,when nobody is watching.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:17.54,0:07:20.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for patience with learning,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:20.11,0:07:22.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,courage with responsibility,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:22.28,0:07:24.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,and enough humility to receive
Dialogue: 4,0:07:24.61,0:07:26.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,correction without turning it
Dialogue: 4,0:07:26.87,0:07:29.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,into a judgment on my worth.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:30.22,0:07:30.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:30.62,0:07:32.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me remember the people
Dialogue: 4,0:07:32.76,0:07:34.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,behind each request.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:34.52,0:07:37.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,The colleague who sounds impatient may
Dialogue: 4,0:07:37.24,0:07:39.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,be carrying pressure I cannot see.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:39.86,0:07:42.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,The person I serve deserves attention
Dialogue: 4,0:07:42.77,0:07:45.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,even when the task feels repetitive.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:45.78,0:07:48.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from passing my frustration
Dialogue: 4,0:07:48.44,0:07:51.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,to someone with less power to answer.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:51.42,0:07:53.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me words that clarify
Dialogue: 4,0:07:53.50,0:07:55.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,expectations and the courage
Dialogue: 4,0:07:55.74,0:07:58.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,to speak about an unreasonable load.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:58.79,0:08:01.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me contribute to a workplace
Dialogue: 4,0:08:01.10,0:08:03.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,where people can tell the truth,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:03.42,0:08:04.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,ask for help,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:04.36,0:08:06.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,and be treated with dignity.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:07.56,0:08:08.81,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD will give
Dialogue: 5,0:08:08.81,0:08:10.71,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}strength unto his people;
Dialogue: 5,0:08:10.71,0:08:12.00,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the LORD will bless
Dialogue: 5,0:08:12.00,0:08:13.83,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}his people with peace.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:14.96,0:08:16.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,This psalm brings strength
Dialogue: 4,0:08:16.64,0:08:18.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,and peace together.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:18.04,0:08:19.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may need both before
Dialogue: 4,0:08:19.79,0:08:21.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,your morning is over.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:21.49,0:08:23.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may need strength to finish
Dialogue: 4,0:08:23.71,0:08:25.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,something demanding and peace
Dialogue: 4,0:08:25.78,0:08:27.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,to keep your words measured.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:27.96,0:08:30.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may need strength to tell
Dialogue: 4,0:08:30.05,0:08:31.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,the truth and peace
Dialogue: 4,0:08:31.42,0:08:33.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,to listen after you speak.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:33.48,0:08:35.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let this verse accompany
Dialogue: 4,0:08:35.39,0:08:37.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,the work of your hands.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:37.41,0:08:40.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can be diligent without treating
Dialogue: 4,0:08:40.26,0:08:42.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,every interruption as an enemy
Dialogue: 4,0:08:42.63,0:08:45.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,or every delay as a personal defeat.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:46.66,0:08:48.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me strength for the effort
Dialogue: 4,0:08:48.91,0:08:50.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,this day requires,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:50.22,0:08:50.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:50.76,0:08:53.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me recognize the difference
Dialogue: 4,0:08:53.03,0:08:54.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,between something urgent
Dialogue: 4,0:08:54.74,0:08:56.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,and something merely loud.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:56.76,0:08:59.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,When several demands arrive together,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:59.65,0:09:02.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,guide me to sort them wisely.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:02.08,0:09:03.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me ask what is needed,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:03.98,0:09:05.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,what can wait,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:05.01,0:09:07.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,and what should be shared.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:07.09,0:09:09.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep hurry from deciding
Dialogue: 4,0:09:09.00,0:09:10.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,how I treat people.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:10.70,0:09:12.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,I offer you the pace
Dialogue: 4,0:09:12.13,0:09:12.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,of my day,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:12.84,0:09:14.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,including the moments when
Dialogue: 4,0:09:14.70,0:09:16.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,slowing down a little would help
Dialogue: 4,0:09:16.99,0:09:19.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,me do the work more carefully.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:20.31,0:09:20.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:20.83,0:09:22.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring you the limits
Dialogue: 4,0:09:22.48,0:09:24.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,I find difficult to accept.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:24.69,0:09:27.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,There are hours I cannot add
Dialogue: 4,0:09:27.18,0:09:29.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,and responsibilities I
Dialogue: 4,0:09:29.14,0:09:31.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,cannot carry alone.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:31.02,0:09:32.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me make an honest plan
Dialogue: 4,0:09:32.97,0:09:35.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the strength and time available.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:35.82,0:09:37.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me grace to say
Dialogue: 4,0:09:37.31,0:09:38.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,what I can do without
Dialogue: 4,0:09:38.88,0:09:40.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,promising what I cannot.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:40.85,0:09:43.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,If today includes searching for work
Dialogue: 4,0:09:43.70,0:09:46.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,or waiting for an opportunity,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:46.08,0:09:47.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,keep my hope patient
Dialogue: 4,0:09:47.66,0:09:49.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my steps practical.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:49.67,0:09:52.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me receive support without
Dialogue: 4,0:09:52.04,0:09:54.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,shame and offer it without pride.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:55.75,0:09:58.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,A soft answer turneth away wrath:
Dialogue: 4,0:09:58.64,0:10:01.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,but grievous words stir up anger.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:02.83,0:10:04.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Picture the next conversation
Dialogue: 4,0:10:04.90,0:10:06.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,that could become tense.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:06.79,0:10:08.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,You cannot choose
Dialogue: 4,0:10:08.05,0:10:09.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,the other person's tone,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:09.83,0:10:12.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,but you can attend to your own.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:12.30,0:10:15.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,A gentle answer can still be clear.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:15.34,0:10:17.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can state a boundary,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:17.29,0:10:19.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,correct a misunderstanding,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:19.39,0:10:21.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,or ask for a moment to think.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:21.84,0:10:23.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to answer
Dialogue: 4,0:10:23.81,0:10:26.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,every sharp word immediately.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:26.28,0:10:28.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let this proverb give you a little
Dialogue: 4,0:10:28.70,0:10:30.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,space between what you hear
Dialogue: 4,0:10:30.62,0:10:31.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,and what you choose
Dialogue: 4,0:10:31.96,0:10:33.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,to say in return.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:34.35,0:10:34.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:34.76,0:10:37.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,I offer you my first response
Dialogue: 4,0:10:37.10,0:10:39.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,when I feel criticized.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:39.14,0:10:41.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me hear the whole sentence
Dialogue: 4,0:10:41.46,0:10:43.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,before preparing my defense.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:43.74,0:10:46.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,If my words have wounded someone,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:46.42,0:10:48.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me a sincere apology
Dialogue: 4,0:10:48.46,0:10:50.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,without excuses attached.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:50.68,0:10:52.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,If I need to speak firmly,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:52.69,0:10:54.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me do it with care.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:54.72,0:10:56.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from using silence
Dialogue: 4,0:10:56.92,0:10:59.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,as punishment or kindness as
Dialogue: 4,0:10:59.30,0:11:01.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,a way to hide resentment.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:01.60,0:11:03.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my words be clear enough
Dialogue: 4,0:11:03.60,0:11:06.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,to understand and gentle enough to leave
Dialogue: 4,0:11:06.46,0:11:09.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,room for another person's dignity.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:10.08,0:11:11.91,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}And let the peace of God
Dialogue: 5,0:11:11.91,0:11:13.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}rule in your hearts,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:13.44,0:11:14.97,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}to the which also ye
Dialogue: 5,0:11:14.97,0:11:16.91,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}are called in one body;
Dialogue: 5,0:11:16.91,0:11:19.05,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and be ye thankful.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:20.18,0:11:22.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,The verse speaks of people
Dialogue: 4,0:11:22.12,0:11:23.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,called into one body.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:23.86,0:11:26.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Peace reaches beyond your private
Dialogue: 4,0:11:26.13,0:11:28.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,thoughts into the life you share.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:28.58,0:11:31.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may live with a full household,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,with one other person,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:33.20,0:11:34.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,or on your own.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:34.59,0:11:36.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,You still belong among people
Dialogue: 4,0:11:36.52,0:11:38.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,who need patience and care.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:38.50,0:11:40.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Think of the table, the kitchen,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:40.83,0:11:42.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,the shared hallway,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:42.22,0:11:44.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,or the conversation by phone.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:44.51,0:11:47.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can make one of those ordinary
Dialogue: 4,0:11:47.08,0:11:49.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,places more welcoming through
Dialogue: 4,0:11:49.27,0:11:51.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,the way you listen today.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:52.34,0:11:52.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:52.68,0:11:54.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring you the place
Dialogue: 4,0:11:54.48,0:11:55.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,I call home.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:55.68,0:11:58.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,Meet us in the hurried breakfast,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:58.37,0:11:59.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,the misplaced keys,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:59.91,0:12:01.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the small jobs
Dialogue: 4,0:12:01.38,0:12:03.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,that somebody must do.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:03.35,0:12:05.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me notice what needs
Dialogue: 4,0:12:05.37,0:12:07.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,attention without letting
Dialogue: 4,0:12:07.40,0:12:10.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,irritation become my usual voice.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:10.25,0:12:12.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where there is tension,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:12.02,0:12:13.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,guide us toward honest
Dialogue: 4,0:12:13.72,0:12:16.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,conversation and wise support.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:16.21,0:12:18.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where there is loneliness,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:18.12,0:12:20.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me make room for connection.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:20.72,0:12:22.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask that my home become
Dialogue: 4,0:12:22.81,0:12:24.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,a place where care is
Dialogue: 4,0:12:24.56,0:12:26.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,practiced in ordinary,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:26.40,0:12:27.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,visible ways.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:28.66,0:12:29.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:29.21,0:12:30.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the people
Dialogue: 4,0:12:30.63,0:12:32.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,I love into your care.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:32.53,0:12:34.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think of each as a person
Dialogue: 4,0:12:34.55,0:12:36.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,with their own questions,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:36.42,0:12:38.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,hopes, and burdens.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:38.02,0:12:40.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me listen closely enough to learn
Dialogue: 4,0:12:40.51,0:12:42.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,what support would actually help.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:42.86,0:12:44.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me patience when their
Dialogue: 4,0:12:44.85,0:12:46.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,pace differs from mine.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:46.73,0:12:49.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lead me to encourage without taking
Dialogue: 4,0:12:49.47,0:12:52.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,over and to remain present without
Dialogue: 4,0:12:52.14,0:12:55.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,demanding that everything be explained.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:55.38,0:12:58.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bless our conversations with honesty,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:58.26,0:12:59.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,affection,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:59.04,0:13:00.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the freedom to ask
Dialogue: 4,0:13:00.75,0:13:02.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,for what we need.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:03.26,0:13:05.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pray for the loved one
Dialogue: 4,0:13:05.23,0:13:08.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot sit beside this morning.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:08.13,0:13:09.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,I miss knowing the little
Dialogue: 4,0:13:09.98,0:13:11.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,details of their day.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:11.72,0:13:13.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me express care
Dialogue: 4,0:13:13.16,0:13:15.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,in a way they can receive,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:15.02,0:13:17.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,perhaps through a thoughtful
Dialogue: 4,0:13:17.02,0:13:19.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,message or a patient call.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:19.07,0:13:20.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I am tempted to fill
Dialogue: 4,0:13:20.86,0:13:22.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,the distance with worry,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:22.58,0:13:23.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,remind me to bring
Dialogue: 4,0:13:23.87,0:13:25.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,that concern to you.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:25.48,0:13:27.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide them toward wise help
Dialogue: 4,0:13:27.61,0:13:29.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,and good companionship.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:29.60,0:13:31.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me to love faithfully
Dialogue: 4,0:13:31.64,0:13:34.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,across the space between us.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:34.92,0:13:37.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let one person come to mind now.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:37.88,0:13:39.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to rehearse
Dialogue: 4,0:13:39.94,0:13:41.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,their whole story.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:41.49,0:13:43.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Remember their face,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:43.12,0:13:45.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,or simply their name.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:45.00,0:13:47.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hold that person before God
Dialogue: 4,0:13:47.08,0:13:49.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,for this brief quiet moment.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:49.42,0:13:50.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can pray, Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:50.93,0:13:53.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me love them well today.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:56.90,0:13:58.80,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Now the God of hope fill
Dialogue: 5,0:13:58.80,0:14:00.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}you with all joy
Dialogue: 5,0:14:00.06,0:14:01.87,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and peace in believing,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:01.87,0:14:04.00,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that ye may abound in hope,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:04.00,0:14:07.19,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}through the power of the Holy Ghost.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:08.32,0:14:10.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can bring an unfinished
Dialogue: 4,0:14:10.45,0:14:12.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,situation into these words.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:12.75,0:14:15.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you are waiting for a reply,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:15.67,0:14:16.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,a decision,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:16.57,0:14:18.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a change that has taken
Dialogue: 4,0:14:18.68,0:14:20.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,longer than expected.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:20.57,0:14:22.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hope can help you remain open
Dialogue: 4,0:14:22.62,0:14:24.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,to goodness while you wait.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:24.72,0:14:26.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to predict
Dialogue: 4,0:14:26.65,0:14:29.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,the outcome to ask God for peace.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:29.29,0:14:31.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let this blessing give
Dialogue: 4,0:14:31.05,0:14:33.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,language to your desire:
Dialogue: 4,0:14:33.16,0:14:35.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,enough hope to remain present,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:35.55,0:14:38.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,enough joy to recognize a gift,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:38.02,0:14:39.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,enough peace to continue
Dialogue: 4,0:14:39.94,0:14:41.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,with today's work.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:42.55,0:14:43.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,God of hope,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:43.49,0:14:46.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for help in the waiting.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:46.02,0:14:47.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have looked at the same
Dialogue: 4,0:14:47.75,0:14:49.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,message and checked the same
Dialogue: 4,0:14:49.69,0:14:51.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,place for an answer.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:51.26,0:14:52.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me know when there
Dialogue: 4,0:14:52.86,0:14:54.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,is a useful step to take
Dialogue: 4,0:14:54.53,0:14:55.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,and when I need to
Dialogue: 4,0:14:55.79,0:14:57.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,leave room for time.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:57.36,0:14:59.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from spending all
Dialogue: 4,0:14:59.15,0:15:01.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,my attention on what has not arrived.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:01.96,0:15:03.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me care for the life
Dialogue: 4,0:15:03.73,0:15:05.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,around me while I wait.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:05.60,0:15:08.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Please sustain my hope without making
Dialogue: 4,0:15:08.40,0:15:11.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,me impatient with the present.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:11.86,0:15:12.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:12.23,0:15:13.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring you the sadness
Dialogue: 4,0:15:13.97,0:15:16.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,that a new morning does not erase.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:16.73,0:15:19.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,There are people I miss and changes
Dialogue: 4,0:15:19.36,0:15:22.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am still learning to live with.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:22.03,0:15:23.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Allow me to be honest
Dialogue: 4,0:15:23.75,0:15:25.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,about that sorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:25.41,0:15:27.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me accept company when
Dialogue: 4,0:15:27.38,0:15:29.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,I need it and a quiet moment
Dialogue: 4,0:15:29.43,0:15:31.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,when words are difficult.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:31.43,0:15:33.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for the tenderness to treat
Dialogue: 4,0:15:33.97,0:15:36.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,myself and others patiently.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:36.31,0:15:37.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let some small sign
Dialogue: 4,0:15:37.80,0:15:39.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,of care reach me today,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:39.60,0:15:41.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,and help me recognize
Dialogue: 4,0:15:41.25,0:15:42.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,it when it comes.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:43.76,0:15:46.08,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Cast thy burden upon the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:46.08,0:15:48.27,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and he shall sustain thee:
Dialogue: 5,0:15:48.27,0:15:49.74,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he shall never suffer
Dialogue: 5,0:15:49.74,0:15:51.90,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the righteous to be moved.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:53.04,0:15:55.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,The psalm gives you a place
Dialogue: 4,0:15:55.15,0:15:56.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,to bring a burden.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:56.74,0:15:59.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may also need another person
Dialogue: 4,0:15:59.20,0:16:01.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,to help you carry today's
Dialogue: 4,0:16:01.12,0:16:03.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,practical responsibilities.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:03.38,0:16:04.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can pray and ask
Dialogue: 4,0:16:04.96,0:16:06.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,for that help.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:06.25,0:16:08.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can tell a trusted friend
Dialogue: 4,0:16:08.48,0:16:10.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,that the morning feels hard,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:10.63,0:16:11.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,accept a meal,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:11.71,0:16:14.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,or ask someone to share a task.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:14.28,0:16:16.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receiving care does not make
Dialogue: 4,0:16:16.42,0:16:18.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,your prayer less sincere.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:18.51,0:16:20.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,It can be one of the ways
Dialogue: 4,0:16:20.29,0:16:22.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,you acknowledge that you were never
Dialogue: 4,0:16:22.78,0:16:25.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,meant to manage everything alone.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:26.30,0:16:26.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:26.84,0:16:28.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,I entrust this weight
Dialogue: 4,0:16:28.46,0:16:29.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,to you and ask for
Dialogue: 4,0:16:29.85,0:16:31.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,the support I need.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:31.50,0:16:34.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me name my need clearly instead
Dialogue: 4,0:16:34.15,0:16:36.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,of hoping someone will guess it.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:36.69,0:16:38.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me discernment about whom
Dialogue: 4,0:16:38.84,0:16:41.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,to trust and courage to reach out.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:41.46,0:16:42.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I can lighten
Dialogue: 4,0:16:42.85,0:16:44.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,another person's load,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:44.46,0:16:46.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,make me attentive and willing.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:46.84,0:16:49.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me offer practical kindness
Dialogue: 4,0:16:49.41,0:16:52.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,without making promises I cannot keep.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:52.74,0:16:54.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me the shared work
Dialogue: 4,0:16:54.46,0:16:56.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,of receiving care gratefully
Dialogue: 4,0:16:56.47,0:16:58.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,and giving care with patience.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:59.81,0:17:01.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pray for the people
Dialogue: 4,0:17:01.34,0:17:03.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,whose mornings touch mine:
Dialogue: 4,0:17:03.42,0:17:05.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,the driver, the shop worker,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:05.46,0:17:06.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,the neighbour,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:06.48,0:17:08.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,the person walking past.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:08.40,0:17:10.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Each carries a life
Dialogue: 4,0:17:10.05,0:17:11.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,beyond what I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:11.78,0:17:13.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from treating them
Dialogue: 4,0:17:13.79,0:17:16.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,as obstacles in my schedule.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:16.12,0:17:18.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I can offer consideration,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:18.79,0:17:20.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,let me do it freely.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:20.63,0:17:22.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where someone needs assistance
Dialogue: 4,0:17:22.98,0:17:24.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,beyond what I can give,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:24.78,0:17:27.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,guide them toward reliable help.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:27.47,0:17:29.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my small choices add patience
Dialogue: 4,0:17:29.98,0:17:32.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,to the places I enter and leave
Dialogue: 4,0:17:32.34,0:17:34.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,others with a little more
Dialogue: 4,0:17:34.25,0:17:35.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,room to breathe.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:36.65,0:17:38.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now gather a few words
Dialogue: 4,0:17:38.34,0:17:40.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the hours after this prayer.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:40.97,0:17:42.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have brought your worry,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:42.88,0:17:44.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,your work, your home,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:44.31,0:17:46.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,and your loved ones before God.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:46.61,0:17:48.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,These next readings can accompany
Dialogue: 4,0:17:48.99,0:17:50.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,the small choices through
Dialogue: 4,0:17:50.79,0:17:52.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,which your day takes shape.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:52.91,0:17:54.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can listen for one verse
Dialogue: 4,0:17:54.95,0:17:56.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,that speaks to the
Dialogue: 4,0:17:56.25,0:17:58.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,situation ahead of you.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:58.10,0:18:00.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep it close enough to remember
Dialogue: 4,0:18:00.39,0:18:02.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,when the room grows busy
Dialogue: 4,0:18:02.10,0:18:05.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,or your attention begins to scatter.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:06.06,0:18:07.53,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Great peace have they
Dialogue: 5,0:18:07.53,0:18:09.05,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}which love thy law:
Dialogue: 5,0:18:09.05,0:18:11.64,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and nothing shall offend them.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:12.77,0:18:15.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can receive this verse as
Dialogue: 4,0:18:15.19,0:18:18.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,an invitation to love God's instruction.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:18.71,0:18:20.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,The psalm celebrates
Dialogue: 4,0:18:20.35,0:18:22.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,a life shaped by his word.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:22.67,0:18:25.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may still feel hurt or troubled;
Dialogue: 4,0:18:25.62,0:18:28.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can bring those feelings honestly
Dialogue: 4,0:18:28.36,0:18:31.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,while seeking a faithful way forward.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:31.28,0:18:33.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Read with the intention
Dialogue: 4,0:18:33.13,0:18:35.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,to practice what you understand.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:35.88,0:18:37.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,A verse can guide
Dialogue: 4,0:18:37.15,0:18:38.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,the answer you give,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:38.65,0:18:40.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,the promise you keep,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:40.22,0:18:42.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the decision you reconsider.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:42.80,0:18:45.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your love for Scripture
Dialogue: 4,0:18:45.02,0:18:46.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,take an ordinary,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:46.42,0:18:48.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,visible form today.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:49.16,0:18:49.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:49.56,0:18:52.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,keep these readings from becoming words
Dialogue: 4,0:18:52.63,0:18:55.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,I hear and immediately set aside.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:55.40,0:18:56.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me remember
Dialogue: 4,0:18:56.64,0:18:58.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,one when I need it.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:58.29,0:18:59.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me the willingness
Dialogue: 4,0:18:59.87,0:19:02.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,to be changed by what I understand,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:02.28,0:19:04.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,especially where my habits
Dialogue: 4,0:19:04.07,0:19:06.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,are familiar and comfortable.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:06.24,0:19:09.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,If your word calls me toward patience,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:09.09,0:19:10.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,let me practice patience
Dialogue: 4,0:19:10.88,0:19:12.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,with an actual person.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:12.71,0:19:15.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,If it calls me toward gratitude,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:15.25,0:19:17.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,let me say thank you.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:17.10,0:19:19.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the truth I receive this morning
Dialogue: 4,0:19:19.82,0:19:22.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,shape the way I live this afternoon.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:23.71,0:19:24.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,Take therefore no
Dialogue: 4,0:19:24.96,0:19:26.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,thought for the morrow:
Dialogue: 5,0:19:26.82,0:19:28.87,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for the morrow shall take thought
Dialogue: 5,0:19:28.87,0:19:30.60,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for the things of itself.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:30.60,0:19:32.56,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Sufficient unto the day
Dialogue: 5,0:19:32.56,0:19:34.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}is the evil thereof.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:35.75,0:19:37.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can prepare responsibly
Dialogue: 4,0:19:37.70,0:19:39.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,for tomorrow while giving
Dialogue: 4,0:19:39.50,0:19:41.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,today's work your attention.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:41.69,0:19:43.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jesus' words address the worry
Dialogue: 4,0:19:43.90,0:19:46.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,that pulls you ahead of the life
Dialogue: 4,0:19:46.26,0:19:48.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can actually live.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:48.06,0:19:50.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can write down a task,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:50.06,0:19:51.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,make a necessary plan,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:51.76,0:19:53.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,and then return to the hour
Dialogue: 4,0:19:53.84,0:19:55.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,in front of you.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:55.26,0:19:57.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,When your mind starts borrowing
Dialogue: 4,0:19:57.42,0:19:58.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,another day's trouble,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:58.96,0:20:00.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,remember the person waiting
Dialogue: 4,0:20:00.84,0:20:02.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,for your attention now.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:02.63,0:20:06.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Remember the useful step available now.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:06.11,0:20:08.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are here, in this morning.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:09.70,0:20:10.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:10.21,0:20:11.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me live within
Dialogue: 4,0:20:11.60,0:20:13.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,the day you have given me.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:13.68,0:20:15.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring tomorrow's questions
Dialogue: 4,0:20:15.87,0:20:18.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,to you and ask for wisdom about
Dialogue: 4,0:20:18.29,0:20:20.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,any preparation needed today.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:20.73,0:20:23.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then help me return to the present
Dialogue: 4,0:20:23.04,0:20:24.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,with a willing heart.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:24.64,0:20:26.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want to taste my breakfast,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:26.86,0:20:28.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,hear the person speaking,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:28.78,0:20:31.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,and do the task I have begun.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:31.18,0:20:33.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me attentive to moments
Dialogue: 4,0:20:33.43,0:20:35.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,I might rush past.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:35.05,0:20:37.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me leave room for an unexpected
Dialogue: 4,0:20:37.83,0:20:39.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,kindness and enough patience
Dialogue: 4,0:20:39.99,0:20:42.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,to recognize an unexpected need.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:43.64,0:20:46.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now the Lord of peace himself give
Dialogue: 4,0:20:46.36,0:20:48.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,you peace always by all means.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:48.94,0:20:51.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Lord be with you all.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:52.40,0:20:53.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,Carry this blessing
Dialogue: 4,0:20:53.88,0:20:55.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,into a change of plans.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:55.84,0:20:57.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your peaceful morning may
Dialogue: 4,0:20:57.82,0:20:59.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,soon include traffic,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:59.49,0:21:01.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,a delayed appointment,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:01.23,0:21:04.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a conversation you did not expect.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:04.34,0:21:06.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can return to prayer
Dialogue: 4,0:21:06.03,0:21:07.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,within that moment.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:07.55,0:21:09.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to protect
Dialogue: 4,0:21:09.43,0:21:11.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,these minutes by resenting
Dialogue: 4,0:21:11.32,0:21:13.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,everything that comes afterward.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:13.81,0:21:15.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can ask for peace
Dialogue: 4,0:21:15.72,0:21:18.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the situation as it is.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:18.26,0:21:21.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the words about the Lord's presence
Dialogue: 4,0:21:21.19,0:21:23.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,accompany you through the ordinary
Dialogue: 4,0:21:23.74,0:21:25.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,movement from one
Dialogue: 4,0:21:25.02,0:21:27.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,responsibility to the next.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:28.23,0:21:29.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord of peace,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:29.31,0:21:31.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,stay near in my awareness
Dialogue: 4,0:21:31.24,0:21:33.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,when the day becomes crowded.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:33.66,0:21:35.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,If something interrupts my plan,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:35.99,0:21:38.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me look carefully before
Dialogue: 4,0:21:38.10,0:21:39.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,deciding what it means.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:39.96,0:21:42.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me patience with necessary
Dialogue: 4,0:21:42.51,0:21:44.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,delays and wisdom about
Dialogue: 4,0:21:44.41,0:21:46.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,what deserves a response.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:46.64,0:21:49.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I feel my words getting sharp,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:49.35,0:21:51.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me stop and begin again.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:51.78,0:21:53.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for a spirit that can
Dialogue: 4,0:21:53.82,0:21:56.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,adapt without abandoning care.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:56.26,0:21:58.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me recognize chances to serve
Dialogue: 4,0:21:58.86,0:22:02.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,within the day that actually unfolds.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:02.95,0:22:05.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you lose your patience later,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:05.25,0:22:08.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can acknowledge it and begin again.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:08.23,0:22:10.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can repair a careless word,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:10.68,0:22:12.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,take responsibility,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:12.26,0:22:15.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,and return to the verse you chose.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:15.13,0:22:17.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,This prayer does not require
Dialogue: 4,0:22:17.22,0:22:19.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,you to maintain a perfect
Dialogue: 4,0:22:19.09,0:22:20.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,feeling until evening.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:20.92,0:22:23.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are practicing a faithful
Dialogue: 4,0:22:23.21,0:22:25.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,response in a real day.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:25.22,0:22:27.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Each return matters.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:27.42,0:22:29.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can bring the next worry
Dialogue: 4,0:22:29.42,0:22:31.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,to God with the same honesty
Dialogue: 4,0:22:31.41,0:22:33.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,you brought to the first
Dialogue: 4,0:22:33.12,0:22:34.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,one this morning.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:35.51,0:22:38.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can make these words your own:
Dialogue: 4,0:22:38.25,0:22:40.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will bring my concerns
Dialogue: 4,0:22:40.33,0:22:41.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,to God honestly.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:41.89,0:22:43.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will notice one
Dialogue: 4,0:22:43.19,0:22:44.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,gift and give thanks.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:44.97,0:22:47.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will listen before I answer.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:47.62,0:22:49.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will ask for wisdom
Dialogue: 4,0:22:49.29,0:22:50.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,when I need it.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:50.66,0:22:52.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will make room for help
Dialogue: 4,0:22:52.57,0:22:55.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,and offer the care I can give.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:55.05,0:22:57.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,With Christ's words in my memory,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:57.62,0:23:00.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will take responsibility for the next
Dialogue: 4,0:23:00.65,0:23:03.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,loving step within my reach.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:04.21,0:23:06.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Think ahead to one likely
Dialogue: 4,0:23:06.16,0:23:07.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,point of pressure:
Dialogue: 4,0:23:07.74,0:23:09.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,opening your messages,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:09.40,0:23:10.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,entering a meeting,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:10.84,0:23:12.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,beginning a difficult task,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:12.88,0:23:15.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,or greeting someone at home.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:15.18,0:23:17.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,Choose one of those moments now.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:17.96,0:23:20.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can remember it without rehearsing
Dialogue: 4,0:23:20.72,0:23:23.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,everything that might go wrong.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:23.15,0:23:25.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,That moment will be your invitation
Dialogue: 4,0:23:25.70,0:23:28.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,to practice what you have prayed.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:28.28,0:23:30.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,Place a short reminder where
Dialogue: 4,0:23:30.21,0:23:32.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,you will see it if that helps.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:32.45,0:23:35.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,The aim is one attentive response when
Dialogue: 4,0:23:35.64,0:23:38.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,your usual habit would be to hurry.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:39.75,0:23:42.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here is your commitment for today:
Dialogue: 4,0:23:42.71,0:23:45.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,before answering the first message
Dialogue: 4,0:23:45.34,0:23:47.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,or request that makes you tense,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:47.81,0:23:48.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,pause.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:48.46,0:23:50.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,Name the concern to God
Dialogue: 4,0:23:50.48,0:23:52.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,in one sentence.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:52.07,0:23:54.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank him for one real gift.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:54.83,0:23:56.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then pray, Jesus,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:56.23,0:23:59.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,guide my next words in your peace.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:59.21,0:24:00.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:00.01,0:24:01.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,give the most truthful
Dialogue: 4,0:24:01.61,0:24:04.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,and considerate response you can.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:04.19,0:24:05.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you need time,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:05.81,0:24:07.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,say so kindly.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:07.32,0:24:09.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can carry John fourteen,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:09.49,0:24:11.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,verse twenty-seven with you as
Dialogue: 4,0:24:11.82,0:24:13.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,you practice this one
Dialogue: 4,0:24:13.44,0:24:15.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,deliberate response.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:16.38,0:24:16.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:16.92,0:24:18.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,I offer you that specific
Dialogue: 4,0:24:18.84,0:24:20.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,moment before it arrives.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:20.95,0:24:22.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me recognize it
Dialogue: 4,0:24:22.45,0:24:24.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,and remember this prayer.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:24.50,0:24:27.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for enough patience to pause,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:27.32,0:24:30.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,enough honesty to name my concern,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:30.06,0:24:31.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,and enough gratitude
Dialogue: 4,0:24:31.68,0:24:33.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,to notice your goodness.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:33.79,0:24:34.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jesus,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:34.30,0:24:37.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,guide my next words in your peace.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:37.36,0:24:39.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where an apology is needed,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:39.49,0:24:40.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me give it.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:40.94,0:24:43.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where a clear boundary is needed,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:43.33,0:24:44.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me state it.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:44.74,0:24:47.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let this small commitment become
Dialogue: 4,0:24:47.08,0:24:49.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,a faithful expression of the trust
Dialogue: 4,0:24:49.55,0:24:51.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have offered you today.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:52.56,0:24:55.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,As you prepare to continue your morning,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:55.60,0:24:58.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,receive the blessing in Numbers,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:58.02,0:24:59.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,chapter six.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:59.12,0:25:01.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,These words speak of God's keeping,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:01.77,0:25:03.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,grace, and peace.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:03.24,0:25:05.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let them settle beside the concern
Dialogue: 4,0:25:05.67,0:25:07.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,you named at the beginning.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:07.78,0:25:09.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can carry that concern
Dialogue: 4,0:25:09.72,0:25:12.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,into your day with prayer still open
Dialogue: 4,0:25:12.41,0:25:15.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,and your next step held before God.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:16.21,0:25:17.79,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD bless thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:25:17.79,0:25:19.08,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and keep thee:
Dialogue: 5,0:25:19.08,0:25:20.72,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD make his face
Dialogue: 5,0:25:20.72,0:25:21.91,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}shine upon thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:25:21.91,0:25:24.20,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and be gracious unto thee:
Dialogue: 5,0:25:25.34,0:25:26.50,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD lift up
Dialogue: 5,0:25:26.50,0:25:28.40,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}his countenance upon thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:25:28.40,0:25:30.21,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and give thee peace.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:31.54,0:25:32.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:32.02,0:25:33.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,thank you for receiving
Dialogue: 4,0:25:33.62,0:25:35.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,this morning's prayer.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:35.32,0:25:37.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,I entrust my attention,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:37.21,0:25:37.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,my words,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:37.95,0:25:39.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the people
Dialogue: 4,0:25:39.10,0:25:40.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,I love to your care.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:40.92,0:25:43.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me carry what I have heard
Dialogue: 4,0:25:43.25,0:25:45.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,into the next ordinary moment.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:45.69,0:25:47.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,May my response be patient,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:47.91,0:25:49.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,my work honest,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:49.15,0:25:51.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my care practical.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:51.14,0:25:53.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,I go forward asking for your wisdom
Dialogue: 4,0:25:53.88,0:25:56.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,and receiving your grace.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:56.01,0:25:59.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,In the name of Jesus, amen.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:59.94,0:26:01.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you would like to join
Dialogue: 4,0:26:01.79,0:26:03.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,this prayer in the comments,
Dialogue: 4,0:26:03.85,0:26:05.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can write amen.
